# TWO files needed for local dev:
#
# 1. web/.env.local  — read by Vite dev server (pnpm dev)
#    VITE_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
#    VITE_SANITY_DATASET=development
#
# 2. web/.dev.vars   — read by Wrangler (wrangler dev, for the API/D1 locally)
#    VITE_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
#    VITE_SANITY_DATASET=development
#
# Both are gitignored. Copy this file and fill in your Sanity project ID
# (find it at sanity.io/manage after creating a project).
